                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 212.11G/10.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Wilson to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-06-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 21,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Refers to the embassy’s No. 86 of June 8, and states that the foreign office asks
                    when the proofs against Heliodoro Garcia may be presented.</p>
            </div>
